 lightgray\"><mpadded height=\"+4pt\" depth=\"+4pt\" lspace=\"4pt\" width=\"+8pt\"><mn>1</mn></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is indeed a point of inflection.</p>\n</div></div>",
